    {
      "id": "claim_166dbd033b1b441a81b351da7356b901",
      "statement": "Script references in _layouts/music.html and _includes/comments.html carry ?v= version query strings as a cache-busting convention, because GitHub Pages sets Cache-Control: max-age=600 on js/css and Cloudflare caches static assets about four hours; both files' comments require bumping the version when the referenced script changes. The current versions are /js/musicplayer.js?v=4 (_layouts/music.html L119), /js/keepalive.js?v=3 (L125) and /js/comments.js?v=4 (_includes/comments.html L64), and the version exists only on these script tags — there is no manifest or fingerprint pipeline.",
      "evidence": [
